iation":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible: v4.6.dev5.official [f5918a9d3], v4.6.dev6.official [dec5a373d], v4.6.beta1.official [d743736f8]\nNot reproducible: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6], v4.5.stable.official [876b29033], v4.6.dev1.official [8d8041bd4], v4.6.dev2.official [7864ac801], v4.6.dev3.official [9d84f3d13], v4.6.dev4.official [bd2ca13c6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta1 - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (TGL GT2) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11370H @ 3.30GHz (8 threads) - 62.52 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen choosing the `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` Project Setting the project is will be ran in an X11 window, even if Wayland is chosen. It should run in a Wayland window when set to Wayland Display Server.\n\nIt doesn't matter if the Editor itself is run in X11 or Wayland.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set  `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` to Wayland.\n2. Run the project.\n\n<img width=\"1351\" height=\"942\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7283e2fe-c6ba-439a-a854-696e1424126b\" />\n<img width=\"1050\" height=\"656\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4c2c874-1b93-46b1-8dd7-47ae663f0745\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[wayland_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24197746/wayland_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandS